    #         killing quantum_substrate / causal_power / scale_engine /
    #         continuous_dynamics / binding_field / entangled_memory /
    #         causal_topology on every pass ("unsupported ScalarType BFloat16").
    #       - RelationalKnowledgeGraph.update() indexed the active-subset
    #         `corr_recent` with full feature ids, raising IndexError before it
    #         ever reached self.edges, so relations never accumulated.
    #       - replay_thread() multiplied a None phi (process_input can return
    #         None and it is written back into the entry) and died every 10s.
    #   * Three upstream bugs fixed (each also present in referencecode/CS.py,
    #     each firing every cycle; search "bf16->fp32", "_recent_is_full",
    #     "base_phi is None"):
    #       - _get_layer_outputs_np() called .numpy() on bfloat16 activations,
    #         killing quantum_substrate / causal_power / scale_engine /
    #         continuous_dynamics / binding_field / entangled_memory /
    #         causal_topology on every pass ("unsupported ScalarType BFloat16").
    #       - RelationalKnowledgeGraph.update() indexed the active-subset
    #         `corr_recent` with full feature ids, raising IndexError before it
    #         ever reached self.edges, so relations never accumulated.
    #       - replay_thread() multiplied a None phi (process_input can return
    #         None and it is written back into the entry) and died every 10s.
    # Everything else is the source as written, indentation aside.
